# Dependency/build artifacts - never copied into images
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv

# Secrets - must never be baked into an image
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Logs / runtime data
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3

# VCS / tooling
.git
.github
docs
opencode.jsonc
tables.txt
